1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Bai: You came all this way
to keep an eye on me?

2
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Zei: We’re the two finalists.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Zei: If I stop practising,
you get ahead.

4
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,000
Bai: So this is surveillance.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Zei: If we stop together,
neither of us falls behind.

6
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,500
Zei: We both get a break.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Bai: You make a holiday
sound exhausting.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Zei: It’s efficient.

9
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:45,000
Zei: Mom’s never left Dzego.

10
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,500
Zei: Neither have I.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Bai: I know.

12
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,500
Zei: What?

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Bai: You keep looking up.

14
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Zei: Then why bring me?

15
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Bai: I wanted the same thing.

16
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Zei: A fair match?

17
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Bai: Some time with you.
